  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On Qing Mao Mountain, Bai Ning Bing activates Swirl Gu with Fierce Wind Gu while forming an iceblade, and the white iceblade storm appears again.",
        "chapters": [
          167
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "gu_fierce_wind_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Iceblade storm is formed by Iceblade Gu, Swirl Gu, and Fierce Wind Gu. Used together, the three create a move that can attack and defend; without two or more defense Gu working together, a target cannot resist it.",
        "chapters": [
          167
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "iceblade-storm",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_ice_blade_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The storm starts as a small gust, then expands into roaring icy winds and a blizzard. Hard ice covers the floor and keeps Chainsaw Golden Centipede from emerging. The same stretch calls the move hard to display or stop cleanly.",
        "chapters": [
          167
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
